~ intro
# Black background, white text, in an old/ancient but legible font.
# Each line should fade in one by one. Let the player sit with each sentence. Then, fade them all to black.

INTROTEXT: Hear us, lord of scales,
INTROTEXT: We must empty Purgatory with our prayers
INTROTEXT: and tired hearts.
