=> tutorial_demon_1
# Load into the main environment of the game -- the desk in front of the wasteland of purgatory.
# TODO: Text progresses as you click it.
# TODO: Fairly fast read speed.
# TODO: Add in speaking sound effect for both Angel and Devil.
~ tutorial_demon_1
$> VoicePlayer.play("res://audio/devil_talking.wav")
DEMON: First day on the job? [next=auto]
DEMON: Heh, you're toast.
$> VoicePlayer.stop()
$> %AngelBubble.play("res://dialogue_&_narrative.dialogue", "tutorial_angel_1")
=> END

~ tutorial_angel_1
ANGEL: Now, now, have a little faith in them!
ANGEL: It's a relatively simple job.
ANGEL: All you have to do is listen to their pleas for mercy,
ANGEL: and weigh their virtues against their sins.
ANGEL: If you view them favorably, raise them up to Heaven. 
ANGEL: If not...
$> %DemonBubble.play("res://dialogue_&_narrative.dialogue", "tutorial_demon_2")
=> END

~ tutorial_demon_2
DEMON: DRAG THEM DOWN TO HELL. HAHAHA.
