~ chloeheaven_angel_0

if DialogueDump.angelending >= 5
	~ chloeheaven_angel_1
	ANGEL: There are few people who can put their personal feelings aside.
	ANGEL: And make the right decision.
	ANGEL: You made the right decision five times in a row.
	ANGEL: I'm so proud of you.
	$> %DemonBubble.play("res://dialogue_&_narrative.dialogue","chloeheaven_demon_1")
	=> END
	
	~ chloeheaven_demon_1
	DEMON: In fact... even I can admit...
	DEMON: It's the only [#italicize 'only'] right decision you made all day.
	=> END
	=> angelending

else DialogueDump.angelending <= 4
	ANGEL: I know these decisions may feel unfair... 
	ANGEL: But are times when mercy is fairer because it's random.
	
	=> endingchecks

~ chloehell_angel_1
ANGEL: Do you have no heart?
ANGEL: Haven't you sent enough people to the pit today?
$> %DemonBubble.play("res://dialogue_&_narrative.dialogue","chloehell_demon_1")
=> END

~ chloehell_demon_1
DEMON: Don't listen to her.
DEMON: I think you sent that girl exactly where she needs to be.
=> endingchecks

~ endingchecks
if DialogueDump.demonending == 5
	$> %DemonBubble.play("res://dialogue_&_narrative.dialogue","demonending_angel_1")
	=> END
	=> demonending_angel_1
else 
	if DialogueDump.trueending == 5
		$> %DemonBubble.hide()
		$> %AngelBubble.hide()
		=> trueending
	else 
		$> %AngelBubble.play("res://dialogue_&_narrative.dialogue","purgatoryending_angel_1")
		=> purgatoryending_angel_1

~ angelending
=> END
# TODO: angelending_letter UI/asset - angelic seal/letterhead on corporate paper
# Offer of Ascension
# Most know that Heaven is not for everyone, few understand it's not for most of anyone.
# By delivering all Heavenly candidates to Hell -- except for those explitly instructed -- 
# you've demonstrated a deep understanding of the difficult nature of Heaven. We would therefore like to offer you 
# the position of Junior Angel - Choir II. 
# Congratulations, and we look forward to your response.
# Sincerely,
# The Department of Heaven

~ demonending_angel_1
ANGEL: I'm happy you could make the right decision. 
ANGEL: But I'm afraid you made it too late.
ANGEL: [# betrayed] I've already... I've already lodged a complaint with management. [#melodramatic sniffle] 
$> %DemonBubble.play("res://dialogue_&_narrative.dialogue","demonending_demon_1")
=> END

~ demonending_demon_1
DEMON: Don't listen to goody-goody.
DEMON: So what if you lose your job here?
DEMON: I'll put in a word for you downstairs...
$> %DemonBubble.hide()
=> END
 
